# Patch files must check out with LF endings on every platform.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true can turn them into CRLF and break `git apply`.
#
# linguist-language=Text: GitHub otherwise detects *.patch as Diff and paints the
# embedded +/- hunks as a nested diff. Force plain text so PR diffs show these
# as ordinary file changes.
*.patch text eol=lf linguist-language=Text
*.diff  text eol=lf linguist-language=Text
